[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578332950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301#issuecomment-2578332950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101301","id":2578332950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zrj0W","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T18:20:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T18:20:04Z","body":"Out of curiosity, what's the difference between `u8` and `U` prefixes? I believe we've been using `U` so far in such cases. If `u8` is better we might want to also refactor those cases.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578332950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578338618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301#issuecomment-2578338618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101301","id":2578338618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZrlM6","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T18:23:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T18:23:10Z","body":"I like the intentions behind this, but there's two important things to keep in mind:\r\n1. A check like this should be integrated as a pre-commit hook, so the files to check can be automatially passed & evaluated consistently.\r\n2. the `u8` prefix will change from `char` to `char8_t` in C++20[^1]. This will give us an inherent way to denote the character literals, but that *might* make the mixed cases incompatible. I'm down for fully converting from `char` to `char8_t` if/when the time comes, but that would be somewhat forced upon us through this prefix\r\n\r\n[^1]:https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/character_literal","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578338618/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578343879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301#issuecomment-2578343879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101301","id":2578343879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZrmfH","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T18:26:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T18:26:18Z","body":"> Out of curiosity, what's the difference between u8 and U prefixes? I believe we've been using U so far in such cases. If u8 is better we might want to also refactor those cases.\r\n\r\nWe use either `U\"xxx\"` or `String::utf8(\"xxx\")` without `u8`.\r\n\r\n- `U` directly encode UTF-32, so no processing.\r\n- `u8` do nothing at all (in C++20 it's `char8_t` literal).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578343879/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578399218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301#issuecomment-2578399218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101301","id":2578399218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zrz_y","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T18:56:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T18:57:00Z","body":"> Nothing wrong with it, but I'm not sure how useful it is, it might be in the future if we force UTF-8 conversions to work only on `char8_t` literals, but currently it won't catch if non-ASCII string is directly converted to the `String` as ASCII.\r\n\r\nYes, this PR is more of a sanity check than an actual assurance.\r\nThe main use is to avoid accidental mistakes, and to make the use of utf8-strings conscious.\r\n\r\n> A check like this should be integrated as a pre-commit hook, so the files to check can be automatially passed & evaluated consistently.\r\n\r\nThat makes sense to me. I'll add it on the next rebase.\r\n\r\n> the u8 prefix will change from char to char8_t in C++20[1](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301#user-content-fn-1-907a12ab7cf1e88cfdb371e7c5fe4c3e). This will give us an inherent way to denote the character literals, but that might make the mixed cases incompatible. I'm down for fully converting from char to char8_t if/when the time comes, but that would be somewhat forced upon us through this prefix\r\n\r\nCurrently, `String` implicit conversions from non-ascii utf-8 to `String` _would be_ incorrect as they're decoded as `latin1` (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100641). It would be correct to fail as fast as possible and 'force' us to implement a change.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578399218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]